"A blog post states: \"quantized weights file: 2.4 GB\".\nEvidence: the actual file on disk measures 17,559,178,144 bytes (about 16.35 GiB), verified by direct measurement (stat) and an independent sha256 re-check.\nThe \"2.4 GB\" figure was carried over from an early draft of the post and was never measured. The file is a 27-billion-parameter model quantized Q4_K_XL, so a size near 16 GiB is consistent with the architecture."